  (text "2x 74HC14 (Basic) shift 3.3 V -> 5 V and INVERT: firmware drives the PWM active-low. 10k pull-\nups on the ESP side keep the IBT-2 inputs low while the ESP boots (the EN gate keeps the\nbridges disabled anyway). Unused inputs tied to GND."
    (at 15.24 28.04 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ce907f68-270c-5ecb-b656-5b782ebfd94b"))
