  (text "Actuator 2 (LIFT). IDC 2x5 (v3 pinout, flat cable 1:1 to the IBT-2 header): 1 RPWM, 2 LPWM, 3\nR_EN, 4 L_EN (both = EN5 gate), 5 R_IS, 6 L_IS, 7 VCC, 8 GND, 9/10 n.c. IS: 1k (DNP if the\nmodule has one) -> 1.18 V @ 10 A. Pot: 3V3A via 1k (keeps the wiper below ~3.0 V, inside the\nESP ADC range), wiper -> 4.7k/100n -> ADC1."
    (at 15.24 144.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "27dbab3d-5a7e-5bf0-944c-497139c969df"))
